node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# 0009 R1 — the emitted JavaScript is not committed. §3 puts one `.js` beside
# each `.ts`, so the pattern is one entry per directory holding TypeScript and
# nothing broader: two copies of every module is what 0001 §6.1 punishes, and a
# reader cannot tell which one is authoritative. Three of them are 0002 §7's
# parts; the fourth is `tests/`, which 0018 §2 adds and §4 sends here.
core/**/*.js
shell/**/*.js
view/**/*.js
tests/**/*.js

# The site the deploy workflow assembles, for the same reason as the four
# patterns above: it is a copy of files that already exist here, and 0011 §6
# reads it rather than the source tree. It is only ever built in CI — this
# entry is for the session that runs those steps by hand to see what deploys.
_site/
